<item><title>Mali records more than 9 600 gender-based violence cases in 2025</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-records-more-than-9-600-gender-based-violence-cases-in-9481c9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-records-more-than-9-600-gender-based-violence-cases-in-9481c9/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The national programme&apos;s report says more than 7 000 cases involved women, while more than 1,000 victims were men.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:44:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
